UI preview fonts
----------------
Fusion Pixel Font (2026.11.10, Simplified Chinese 10px proportional) and
Noto Sans SC (source commit f8d157532fbfaeda587e826d4cd5b21a49186f7c) are
distributed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. Their complete notices and
licenses are preserved in assets/mtrnav/font/ui/fusion-ofl.txt and noto-ofl.txt.
Noto's TrueType variable font is instantiated at weight 400 using FontTools 4.61.1;
source URLs, verification hashes and the derivation are in ui/font-sources.json.
These fonts apply only to the opt-in MTR Navigation UI preview.

The PaperFont / FontAccessor technique follows Create's NoShadowFontWrapper implementation,
whose Java source is covered by the upstream MIT code license:
Copyright (c) The Create Team / The Creators of Create.
The complete upstream MIT code license text is reproduced in licenses/create-code-MIT.txt.

Transport pictograms referenced from the installed Minecraft Transit Railway mod
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
The journey chain references mtr:textures/block/sign/train.png,
light_rail_1.png and xrl_2.png from the installed MTR dependency. These textures
are not copied into or redistributed inside this project's JAR. Vehicle names,
descriptions and tags are read from the user's active MTR resources.
